      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had the rep come out I told him I was looking at a 10 as I did not want any more bills he advised me that I only needed a 6.9 and should not get any bills if so only very little. He showed me on paper what system would make each month so I too his word and went with his advice. Well 12 months later I am still getting bills and the system has never ever made what he quoted me on paper after making several complaints to the owner stating I did not get what the rep promised he said he would sell me another system to add to existing one at cost price as you would expect I’m not at all happy with that and can’t afford another system. Quote you a price and what it will make and if it does not make what was quoted they will pay the difference. I have given them numerous chances to rectify this problem now he won’t even get back to me so I am seeking legal action as I paid a lot of money and was guaranteed i would have no or very little bill this is certainly not the case very unhappy customer",
